flowchart LR
    A["<b>add / change</b><br/>the Session tracks the object;<br/>nothing has been written"]
    B["<b>flush</b><br/>the INSERT runs inside the<br/>transaction and the key comes back"]
    C["<b>commit</b><br/>the transaction ends, and every<br/>object is expired: the next<br/>attribute you read is a SELECT"]
    A --> B --> C
